=== Information ===
'''Andrew''' was a professional police officer, with his gift for bringing everything to justice, he spent most of his time, in a non-stop of: chasing and capturing criminals.

The shirt he wears, was his best friend in the most difficult moments of his career, at one point he had already forgotten the count of how many struggles he survived wearing it.

And he even created his own motto:<blockquote>''"My call of duty is to seek the truth behind everything"''</blockquote>It is officially reported that Andrew is Kelly's stepfather.

